    "number": 272,
    "title": "test: add dedicated UI test suite for redundant_env_clone lint rule",
    "body": "# Add dedicated UI test suite for redundant_env_clone lint rule\r\n\r\nCloses #28\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nAdds a standalone UI test file for the `redundant_env_clone` lint rule, providing comprehensive coverage of both triggering and non-triggering cases.\r\n\r\n## What changed\r\n\r\n- **`soroban_cost_lints/ui/redundant_env_clone.rs`** — Self-contained test fixture with a minimal `soroban_sdk` mock, containing:\r\n  - 4 triggering cases: simple clone, clone passed to fn, clone inside block expression, clone with variable shadowing\r\n  - 6 non-triggering cases: `&Env` reference clone, env used after clone, clone then fn call then env used, no clone at all, struct field (non-local) clone, `#[allow(redundant_env_clone)]` attribute\r\n- **`soroban_cost_lints/ui/redundant_env_clone.stderr`** — Expected diagnostic output (4 warnings)\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\n- `cargo test -p soroban_cost_lints` — all UI tests pass (both `main.rs` and `redundant_env_clone.rs`)\r\n- `cargo clippy -p soroban_cost_lints --all-targets -- -D warnings` — clean\r\n- No existing files were modified; only new files added to `soroban_cost_lints/ui/`\r\n",
